1
00:00:03,400 --> 00:00:07,170
The radiance of the night shines through my window

2
00:00:07,170 --> 00:00:11,120
but the path to immortality is long.

3
00:00:11,600 --> 00:00:15,850
The Eight Views and Nine-Bend Streams are desolate.

4
00:00:15,850 --> 00:00:21,010
Living beings question the miseries of the world over a jar of wine.

5
00:00:22,280 --> 00:00:25,000
Forget about Nirvana and rebirth,

6
00:00:25,400 --> 00:00:28,250
I will break through the waves with my own flesh and blood.

7
00:00:28,250 --> 00:00:33,520
The heavens are vast, so what if I was born mediocre ?

8
00:00:34,720 --> 00:00:37,480
I stare at the Dao in my moments of madness

9
00:00:37,840 --> 00:00:40,480
as the storm rages just below.

10
00:00:40,880 --> 00:00:44,850
I've been thinking about life and death in my dreams.

11
00:00:44,850 --> 00:00:47,840
I've unsheathed my sword to ask the immortals

12
00:00:48,000 --> 00:00:50,690
why the world is a-changing.

13
00:00:50,710 --> 00:00:54,040
Heaven and earth reveals its poignant truths.

14
00:00:54,280 --> 00:00:57,210
Swallow the Four Seas and the Eight Wastelands,

15
00:00:57,210 --> 00:01:00,290
experience all the vicissitudes of life in an instant.

16
00:01:00,450 --> 00:01:03,170
I will defy the light in the sky

17
00:01:03,170 --> 00:01:06,610
to continue to write a new chapter for all things in the three realms of existence.

18
00:01:15,690 --> 00:01:19,050
Just a thought separates mortal from immortal.

19
00:01:19,210 --> 00:01:22,130
Transform your insignificant body into light.

20
00:01:22,290 --> 00:01:25,250
The hardships of the journey

21
00:01:25,370 --> 00:01:28,210
will temper this young man's heart.

22
00:01:28,210 --> 00:01:32,850
If I become a Renegade Immortal, will I hesitate to fight the heavens ?

23
00:01:39,600 --> 00:01:43,480
Renegade Immortal
Subtitles by Bonobosubs
https://discord.gg/Ceckd4pdVA

24
00:01:49,080 --> 00:01:52,200
War God Shrine
Burning Fire country

25
00:01:52,960 --> 00:01:54,560
The formation is activating.

26
00:01:54,880 --> 00:01:56,040
Here they come.

27
00:01:56,680 --> 00:01:57,480
Look !

28
00:01:57,800 --> 00:01:58,840
They're back.

29
00:02:00,440 --> 00:02:02,000
They're finally back !

30
00:01:59,480 --> 00:02:02,440
Xu Si
War God Shrine disciple
Late stage Foundation Establishment

31
00:02:10,000 --> 00:02:11,480
Welcome back Senior Brothers, Sister Sister.

32
00:02:11,480 --> 00:02:13,040
How was the harvest this time ?

33
00:02:13,040 --> 00:02:14,680
Did you find any powerful artifacts ?

34
00:02:14,680 --> 00:02:16,200
Tell us how it went !

35
00:02:16,320 --> 00:02:19,840
Good, you guys endured the trial of the Foreign Battlefield.

36
00:02:20,040 --> 00:02:22,680
The three of you have greatly improved your cultivation.

37
00:02:24,080 --> 00:02:27,360
Huo Hongfei
War God Shrine Elder
Early stage Core Formation

38
00:02:24,880 --> 00:02:28,120
It's a shame so few of you returned.

39
00:02:31,960 --> 00:02:32,800
Elder,

40
00:02:33,440 --> 00:02:35,040
Junior Brother Ma Liang is still inside.

41
00:02:35,040 --> 00:02:36,320
The situation was critical

42
00:02:36,320 --> 00:02:37,800
so he told the us to leave first.

43
00:02:37,800 --> 00:02:38,720
He’ll catch up soon.

44
00:02:38,760 --> 00:02:40,720
Junior Brother Ma Liang survived ?

45
00:02:40,720 --> 00:02:41,880
Ma Liang isn’t dead !?

46
00:02:42,040 --> 00:02:42,760
Silence.

47
00:02:43,320 --> 00:02:45,240
Were you hoping for Ma Liang's death ?

48
00:02:45,840 --> 00:02:47,600
Is this how your master taught you !?

49
00:02:49,120 --> 00:02:50,120
Don’t worry Junior Sister,

50
00:02:50,880 --> 00:02:53,480
Junior Brother Ma Liang spent 50 years in the Foreign Battlefield

51
00:02:53,520 --> 00:02:55,040
so his temperament has changed.

52
00:02:55,320 --> 00:02:56,240
I don't think

53
00:02:56,240 --> 00:02:58,160
that he will bother you anymore.

54
00:02:59,000 --> 00:03:02,240
Zhou An
War God Shrine disciple
Late stage Foundation Establishment

55
00:02:59,960 --> 00:03:01,270
What’s there to fear ?

56
00:03:01,280 --> 00:03:02,770
If he dares to harass you again,

57
00:03:02,800 --> 00:03:03,720
I’ll handle it.

58
00:03:29,000 --> 00:03:29,720
This is…

59
00:03:30,720 --> 00:03:32,320
such a powerful cold aura...

60
00:03:37,440 --> 00:03:38,720
This aura…

61
00:03:39,400 --> 00:03:40,400
Is this Ma Liang ?

62
00:03:41,360 --> 00:03:42,440
Disciple Ma Liang

63
00:03:42,440 --> 00:03:43,840
pays respects to Elder Huo.

64
00:03:44,160 --> 00:03:45,680
I'm glad you made it back.

65
00:03:45,800 --> 00:03:46,800
Come with me.

66
00:03:47,320 --> 00:03:48,960
Disciple has urgent matters to deal with.

67
00:03:49,760 --> 00:03:52,240
I'll come after I'm done dealing with them.

68
00:03:53,160 --> 00:03:55,800
Here are the items I collected over these 50 years.

69
00:03:56,000 --> 00:03:57,560
The artifacts were destroyed

70
00:03:57,600 --> 00:03:59,200
so only these materials remain.

71
00:03:59,800 --> 00:04:02,440
This kid exudes an unusually cold aura...

72
00:04:03,320 --> 00:04:05,720
I should report this to the Sect Leader.

73
00:04:20,360 --> 00:04:22,600
Let's hide here, Ah Niu won’t find us.

74
00:04:25,560 --> 00:04:27,480
Found you !

75
00:04:43,360 --> 00:04:45,240
An Immortal ! An Immortal !

76
00:04:45,760 --> 00:04:47,360
My mother said that

77
00:04:47,360 --> 00:04:50,840
the volcanoes of the Burning Fire country would've errupted long ago

78
00:04:50,840 --> 00:04:53,040
if they weren't sealed by the Immortals !

79
00:04:53,880 --> 00:04:55,440
I want to become an Immortal too !

80
00:04:55,840 --> 00:04:58,440
Kids, come back for dinner.

81
00:04:58,760 --> 00:04:59,560
Okay !

82
00:05:02,320 --> 00:05:03,450
We're going home !

83
00:05:02,880 --> 00:05:03,640
Mom,

84
00:05:03,640 --> 00:05:05,320
I saw an Immortal today !

85
00:05:06,240 --> 00:05:06,880
Really ?

86
00:05:12,200 --> 00:05:14,320
I need to find a place to cultivate...

87
00:05:20,360 --> 00:05:22,220
I'm glad I held out this long...

88
00:05:22,720 --> 00:05:24,320
Let's first inspect this body.

89
00:05:30,960 --> 00:05:32,960
So this is my Sea of Consciousness.

90
00:05:58,120 --> 00:06:01,440
This red lightning must be the Ji Realm refined by the Law of the World.

91
00:06:01,840 --> 00:06:03,800
Since it resisted the Law of the World,

92
00:06:04,120 --> 00:06:05,480
it must be powerful.

93
00:06:26,760 --> 00:06:30,440
The Ji Realm can actually awaken the Heaven Defying Bead and my sword ?

94
00:06:55,240 --> 00:06:58,600
If this Ji Realm Divine Sense were to fill my Sea of Counsciousness,

95
00:06:59,360 --> 00:07:03,520
even the Law of the World would pale before me.

96
00:07:35,040 --> 00:07:36,800
They must have

97
00:07:37,200 --> 00:07:38,960
outstanding form and spirit !

98
00:07:52,760 --> 00:07:54,520
Father… Mother…

99
00:07:56,240 --> 00:07:58,680
It’s me… I’m Tie Zhu.

100
00:07:59,520 --> 00:08:00,960
Do you still recognize me ?

101
00:08:01,760 --> 00:08:02,840
Once I recover,

102
00:08:03,640 --> 00:08:06,040
I’ll find my way back to the country of Zhao.

103
00:08:07,760 --> 00:08:09,480
I'll deal with Teng Huayuan...

104
00:08:09,560 --> 00:08:11,200
Blood for blood.

105
00:08:21,520 --> 00:08:23,120
Ge Yang and Xu Hao’s bags of holding

106
00:08:23,120 --> 00:08:24,720
had this piece of refined iron.

107
00:08:24,960 --> 00:08:26,000
It's top quality.

108
00:08:28,000 --> 00:08:29,800
I don’t know anything about artifact crafting

109
00:08:29,800 --> 00:08:31,480
so I can't make a new sword.

110
00:08:32,000 --> 00:08:33,040
This will have to do.

111
00:08:42,480 --> 00:08:44,520
1 year later

112
00:08:45,560 --> 00:08:46,080
Senior,

113
00:08:47,000 --> 00:08:49,200
This body is already Middle stage Foundation Establishment.

114
00:08:49,400 --> 00:08:51,080
With the Ji Realm,

115
00:08:51,080 --> 00:08:53,720
I can defeat any Foundation Establishment cultivator.

116
00:08:53,760 --> 00:08:55,600
I'm even confident in facing

117
00:08:55,600 --> 00:08:57,080
Early stage Core Formation.

118
00:09:12,120 --> 00:09:14,360
What is this wood element spiritual energy ?

119
00:09:17,440 --> 00:09:20,360
Burning Gold Mountain Range

120
00:09:21,840 --> 00:09:24,200
Zhou Gang
Corpse Sect disciple
Middle stage Foundation Establishment

121
00:09:21,000 --> 00:09:24,200
Junior Sister An, is this your first time picking Burning Gold Fruits ?

122
00:09:24,720 --> 00:09:25,240
Yes

123
00:09:24,440 --> 00:09:26,240
An Zi
Corpse Sect disciple
Middle stage Foundation Establishment

124
00:09:24,440 --> 00:09:26,240
Ma Yu
Corpse Sect disciple
Middle stage Foundation Establishment

125
00:09:26,040 --> 00:09:28,040
Our Burning Fire country is full of volcanoes

126
00:09:28,040 --> 00:09:30,040
and the spiritual energy is the fire element.

127
00:09:30,040 --> 00:09:33,720
Prolonged exposition to it can harm cultivators.

128
00:09:33,720 --> 00:09:36,200
Only the Soul Harmony Pills made from Burning Gold Fruits

129
00:09:36,200 --> 00:09:38,040
can regulate our spiritual energy.

130
00:09:38,080 --> 00:09:40,680
Are Burning Gold Fruits only found in the Burning Gold Mountains ?

131
00:09:41,080 --> 00:09:42,360
Exactly.

132
00:09:42,360 --> 00:09:44,080
When the fruits are ripe,

133
00:09:44,560 --> 00:09:47,000
disciples from all 4 sects come to harvest them.

134
00:09:59,920 --> 00:10:02,720
The other 3 sects have already entered,

135
00:10:02,760 --> 00:10:04,920
why are we still waiting here ?

136
00:10:05,360 --> 00:10:07,360
Blue mist means the fruits are ripe

137
00:10:07,840 --> 00:10:09,080
and safe to harvest.

138
00:10:09,560 --> 00:10:10,920
Since the mist isn't out yet,

139
00:10:10,920 --> 00:10:13,080
that means there is still poisonous gas in the volcano.

140
00:10:13,080 --> 00:10:14,560
We’ll be in danger

141
00:10:14,560 --> 00:10:15,720
if we go down now.

142
00:10:17,320 --> 00:10:18,040
Enough,

143
00:10:18,040 --> 00:10:18,840
let’s go down.

144
00:10:21,120 --> 00:10:22,280
Hey, you !

145
00:10:22,760 --> 00:10:23,560
What ?

146
00:10:23,800 --> 00:10:26,480
We only harvest 10 fruits per year

147
00:10:26,760 --> 00:10:28,560
to avoid damaging the roots.

148
00:10:28,560 --> 00:10:30,280
Yet you severed the entire root !?

149
00:10:31,200 --> 00:10:32,680
No matter which sect you're from,

150
00:10:32,680 --> 00:10:35,200
you will pay for this offense !

151
00:10:40,200 --> 00:10:41,000
Die.

152
00:10:48,800 --> 00:10:49,680
Damn it, damn it.

153
00:10:51,360 --> 00:10:52,760
Take one more step

154
00:10:53,840 --> 00:10:54,920
and you will die.

155
00:10:59,160 --> 00:11:00,160
A Nascent Soul ?

156
00:11:00,160 --> 00:11:01,640
Fellow cultivator, spare me.

157
00:11:01,640 --> 00:11:02,800
Please have mercy.

158
00:11:02,480 --> 00:11:05,760
Xu Liguo's Nascent Soul
Tian Gang Sect disciple

159
00:11:03,360 --> 00:11:06,960
I’m Xu Liguo, disciple of the Tian Gang Sect of a rank 4 country.

160
00:11:07,040 --> 00:11:08,560
I know I offended you earlier.

161
00:11:08,560 --> 00:11:09,800
Let’s talk this through.

162
00:11:09,800 --> 00:11:11,120
Please, don’t act rashly.

163
00:11:12,240 --> 00:11:16,720
Cultivators stand no chance against the power of the souls here.

164
00:11:17,200 --> 00:11:19,800
If wandering souls enter the mortal world,

165
00:11:19,800 --> 00:11:21,320
they’ll be called devils.

166
00:11:26,120 --> 00:11:26,920
Devils ?

167
00:11:27,680 --> 00:11:28,520
Interesting...

168
00:11:31,280 --> 00:11:32,800
What are you doing !?

169
00:11:42,040 --> 00:11:44,280
I had a Nascent Soul cultivation when I had a body,

170
00:11:44,640 --> 00:11:46,440
a flick of my finger could kill you !

171
00:11:48,080 --> 00:11:49,400
Why isn’t he speaking ?

172
00:11:50,400 --> 00:11:52,040
Is he plotting something ?

173
00:11:52,400 --> 00:11:53,480
Don’t do anything reckless.

174
00:11:53,480 --> 00:11:54,680
Let me tell you something,

175
00:11:54,720 --> 00:11:56,920
if I could afford a Nascent Soul body

176
00:11:57,240 --> 00:11:59,600
instead of this cheap Foundation Establishment one,

177
00:11:59,760 --> 00:12:03,000
I would crush a Foundation Establishment brat like you !

178
00:12:03,000 --> 00:12:04,000
Shut up.

179
00:12:05,680 --> 00:12:06,480
Fellow cultivator !

180
00:12:07,160 --> 00:12:07,960
Let’s talk this through.

181
00:12:08,240 --> 00:12:09,200
Let’s talk this through.

182
00:12:10,080 --> 00:12:11,200
If you spare me,

183
00:12:11,440 --> 00:12:13,160
I’ll agree to anything !

184
00:12:13,640 --> 00:12:15,520
Please calm down, fellow cultivator.

185
00:12:17,080 --> 00:12:19,800
If wandering souls can devour cultivators regardless of their cultivation level,

186
00:12:19,800 --> 00:12:22,720
maybe I could try to refine one here ?

187
00:12:29,560 --> 00:12:31,640
If I had an army of wandering souls,

188
00:12:32,480 --> 00:12:36,520
it would make my vengeance against Teng Huayuan easier.

189
00:12:41,120 --> 00:12:42,080
Hey, hey, hey !

190
00:12:47,520 --> 00:12:48,200
Fellow cultivator…

191
00:12:48,280 --> 00:12:50,320
Please calm down, fellow cultivator !

192
00:12:57,920 --> 00:13:00,080
I erased the original consciousness.

193
00:13:01,160 --> 00:13:03,560
He really was at Nascent Soul...

194
00:13:06,840 --> 00:13:08,080
Who are you ?

195
00:13:08,480 --> 00:13:10,440
And who am I ?

196
00:13:41,760 --> 00:13:42,680
Eat him.

197
00:13:58,920 --> 00:14:00,200
Let me out !

198
00:14:04,120 --> 00:14:06,720
You've really pissed me off !

199
00:14:52,160 --> 00:14:54,440
The devil is done.

200
00:14:59,400 --> 00:15:00,760
You’re courting death !

201
00:15:04,760 --> 00:15:06,120
Hide inside this.

202
00:15:06,320 --> 00:15:08,520
You're not allowed to come out unless I call you.

203
00:15:35,920 --> 00:15:37,520
He’s even stronger now...

204
00:15:37,640 --> 00:15:39,560
Lin Tao pays respects to Master.

205
00:15:41,080 --> 00:15:43,040
Greetings... Senior...

206
00:15:48,280 --> 00:15:49,320
Master,

207
00:15:49,320 --> 00:15:51,960
here are the items you requested 3 days ago.

208
00:15:52,800 --> 00:15:54,680
This is the Artifact Crafting Hall’s jade slip

209
00:15:54,880 --> 00:15:56,840
with detailed artifact crafting methods.

210
00:16:01,160 --> 00:16:04,400
Master, the maps are in the Scripture Pavilion’s top floor.

211
00:16:05,000 --> 00:16:07,640
My cultivation was too low to access it.

212
00:16:09,480 --> 00:16:10,120
10 days !

213
00:16:10,480 --> 00:16:12,120
Master, give me 10 more days !

214
00:16:12,440 --> 00:16:14,360
My cousin will be on duty in 10 days,

215
00:16:14,360 --> 00:16:16,080
I'll ask him to make a copy.

216
00:16:17,320 --> 00:16:18,520
If you succeed,

217
00:16:18,960 --> 00:16:20,760
I’ll return your Soul Blood when I leave

218
00:16:20,760 --> 00:16:22,320
the Burning Fire country.

219
00:16:26,200 --> 00:16:27,200
Master...

220
00:16:28,080 --> 00:16:30,280
I would've returned your Soul Blood now...

221
00:16:30,880 --> 00:16:33,600
But this jade slip’s tracking spell

222
00:16:33,960 --> 00:16:36,400
voids your achievement.

223
00:16:37,000 --> 00:16:38,040
I won’t kill you.

224
00:16:38,240 --> 00:16:39,880
But whether I return your Soul Blood

225
00:16:40,280 --> 00:16:41,840
will depend on what you do next.

226
00:16:42,160 --> 00:16:43,960
I'm glad I didn’t activate the tracking spell

227
00:16:44,040 --> 00:16:45,600
to ask teacher for help.

228
00:16:45,800 --> 00:16:47,720
If I did, I'd be dead already.

229
00:16:48,920 --> 00:16:52,200
Senior, I couldn’t copy the Divine Path.

230
00:16:52,200 --> 00:16:53,920
I tried my hardest to memorize it

231
00:16:54,160 --> 00:16:55,400
but once I left the hall,

232
00:16:55,400 --> 00:16:57,440
I wasn't able to remember the Divine Path.

233
00:16:58,360 --> 00:17:00,040
You’re using Ma Liang’s identity

234
00:17:00,240 --> 00:17:01,400
so if you’re willing

235
00:17:01,400 --> 00:17:02,760
you could visit the War God Shrine

236
00:17:02,760 --> 00:17:04,160
to study the Divine Path.

237
00:17:05,080 --> 00:17:07,000
This Divine Path is very weird...

238
00:17:08,840 --> 00:17:11,000
You don't need to be so on guard near me.

239
00:17:11,840 --> 00:17:13,240
As long as you don’t provoke me,

240
00:17:13,240 --> 00:17:14,560
I’ll return your Soul Blood

241
00:17:14,560 --> 00:17:16,120
when I leave the country.

242
00:17:16,760 --> 00:17:18,280
But if you plot against me,

243
00:17:18,680 --> 00:17:20,440
don’t blame me for being ruthless.

244
00:17:20,560 --> 00:17:21,600
You three may leave.

245
00:17:22,320 --> 00:17:23,120
Lin Tao,

246
00:17:23,760 --> 00:17:25,880
I’ll wait for you here in 10 days.

247
00:17:40,760 --> 00:17:42,800
Going to the War God Shrine is too risky.

248
00:17:42,960 --> 00:17:44,840
Even if these three are not scheming,

249
00:17:45,640 --> 00:17:47,600
if I'm exposed for stealing this body,

250
00:17:47,600 --> 00:17:48,760
I'll be in trouble.

251
00:17:48,760 --> 00:17:49,960
Little friend...

252
00:17:50,600 --> 00:17:54,960
Will you give me my disciple's Soul Blood ?

253
00:18:06,200 --> 00:18:09,480
Feng Luan
War God Shrine Ancestor
Early stage Nascent Soul

254
00:18:14,450 --> 00:20:16,520
Wang Lin says he reached Middle stage Foundation Establishment with this body but he was showed a few episodes before as Late stage Foundation Establishment in his character card. That is because his body and soul's cultivations are not synchronized. In normal circumstances, the body and the soul should be the same level but here Wang Lin's soul became a Soul Devourer and devoured wandering souls during hundreds of years so his soul's cultivation reached Late stage. Now that he has cultivated anew (he started from zero and it took 1 year outside but 10 times as much inside the Heaven Defying Bead), his body is at Middle stage Foundation Establishment.

The Corpse Sect is a tentacular organization that has branches everywhere to sell bodies to cultivators. So this Corpse Sect is not the same as the one in Zhao. In fact, all Corpse Sects on this planet are branches of the real Corpse Sect.

255
00:18:20,190 --> 00:18:25,830
I've been walking this path for endless years

256
00:18:22,490 --> 00:18:25,830
just to catch a glimpse of your silhouette.

257
00:18:26,470 --> 00:18:31,430
Is it the compass of fate

258
00:18:28,310 --> 00:18:31,430
that wrote this outcome for us ?

259
00:18:31,590 --> 00:18:37,350
The heavens want to erase your existence,

260
00:18:37,470 --> 00:18:43,070
that's the obsession guiding me.

261
00:18:43,350 --> 00:18:48,670
Is this the path to uncover

262
00:18:45,230 --> 00:18:48,670
truths from falsehoods ?

263
00:18:48,950 --> 00:18:54,270
In a world of murk and shadow,

264
00:18:50,850 --> 00:18:54,270
only the flame of truth can light the way.

265
00:18:54,310 --> 00:18:59,990
Look at them all,

266
00:18:57,190 --> 00:18:59,990
being carried by the waves.

267
00:19:00,430 --> 00:19:04,630
Look at them all,

268
00:19:02,590 --> 00:19:04,630
being drowned.

269
00:19:04,710 --> 00:19:07,950
I don't want to believe in whoever decides fate,

270
00:19:07,990 --> 00:19:11,030
I will let the world refine my soul.

271
00:19:11,160 --> 00:19:16,590
So what if I become an Immortal and defy the heavens ?

272
00:19:12,850 --> 00:19:16,590
I will fight.

273
00:19:16,590 --> 00:19:19,710
I'll break through the abyss of despair

274
00:19:19,710 --> 00:19:22,750
to finally learn who I really am.

275
00:19:22,750 --> 00:19:28,110
My body is stained by the bloody color of slaughter,

276
00:19:24,630 --> 00:19:28,110
I embrace this obsession.

277
00:19:28,110 --> 00:19:31,070
I won't glance back at the wasteland I left behind.

278
00:19:31,070 --> 00:19:33,870
Even if this suffering shatters my soul

279
00:19:33,870 --> 00:19:39,350
and I'm reborn countless times in hell,

280
00:19:35,910 --> 00:19:39,350
I'll still fight.

281
00:19:39,550 --> 00:19:42,710
It's hard to avoid loneliness

282
00:19:42,710 --> 00:19:45,750
when you are above everyone else.

283
00:19:45,750 --> 00:19:51,430
Can a moth that has witnessed the flames of a Suzaku

284
00:19:48,070 --> 00:19:51,430
be afraid of a firefly ?
